\end{proof}
\end{minipage}\par\medskip

The corollary covers 2,176 draws; 128 OpenAI-3072/$S=128$ draws use distance-only selection. All 2,304 recorded curves are monotone and match enumeration (\cref{sec:7-budget-trace}); this is finite evidence.

